{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_01",
      "hash": "0cadb0ccd724eae7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "坂木：哈哈哈哈哈！\\n欢迎来到我的藏身之所！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_06",
      "hash": "0cadadccd724e5ce",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我本打算\\n在火箭队复活的那天到来之前，\\r\\n先在这座道馆里重整态势！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_07",
      "hash": "0cadaeccd724e781",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "不过……\\n既然被你发现我藏身于此，\\r\\n那也没办法了！\\r\\n这次我是不会手下留情的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_08",
      "hash": "0cada7ccd724db9c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那么……就再让你尝尝！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_09",
      "hash": "0cada8ccd724dd4f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "最强的宝可梦训练家——\\n我坂木的厉害！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "A_TRID_GYM08_01_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE",
      "hash": "5a96627c1c6029ab",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 5]"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_02",
      "hash": "0cadb1ccd724ec9a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……确实是你赢了！\\c\\n为了证明刚才所发生的一切，\\n就把绿色徽章给你吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main8070_sys_01",
      "hash": "024f6b4339ba2b93",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从坂木那里\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]绿色徽章[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_03",
      "hash": "0cadb2ccd724ee4d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "只要你拥有绿色徽章，\\n所有的宝可梦……\\c\\n无论初训家为何人，\\n无论任何等级的宝可梦，\\r\\n都会听命于你！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_10",
      "hash": "0cb0b5ccd727293d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "这是你成为了一名\\n优秀宝可梦训练家的证明！\\c\\n这样一来，\\n你就能挑战宝可梦联盟了吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_11",
      "hash": "0cb0b4ccd727278a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "这个招式学习器就是……！\\n为你准备的\\r\\n挑战宝可梦联盟的饯别之礼了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main8070_sys_02",
      "hash": "024f6c4339ba2d46",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从坂木那里\\n得到了[VAR ITEM2(0001)]\\r\\n“[VAR COLOR(0006)][VAR MOVE(0002)][VAR COLOR(0000)]”！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_04",
      "hash": "0cadabccd724e268",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "招式学习器41是“地震”！\\n这个招式通过让地面强烈摇晃，\\r\\n来对敌人造成巨大的伤害！\\r\\n是一种强有力的招式！"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_12",
      "hash": "0cb0b3ccd72725d7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "这个其实……是我\\n过去还在这里管理道馆时\\r\\n造出来的东西……"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_05",
      "hash": "0cadacccd724e41b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "以这样的方式输给你，\\n我确实没有办法向部下交代！\\c\\n火箭队……\\n就从今天起正式解散！"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_13",
      "hash": "0cb0b2ccd7272424",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我自己，\\n则决定从头开始宝可梦的修行！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_14",
      "hash": "0cb0b1ccd7272271",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "希望有一天……\\n我们还能有机会见面！\\r\\n……再见了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_gymleader_08_07",
      "hash": "0f9eb2d6a81ace20",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 17]"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_8070_max",
      "hash": "966942d8e2229ed0"
    }
  ]
}
